+1. Returns an object with all 5 services plus `installPlugin()`.
+2. **installPlugin(manifest)** - Full workflow:
+   a. Validates name, version, entryPoint are present → throws "Invalid manifest" if not
+   b. Registers the plugin in the registry
+   c. Resolves dependency versions
+   d. Checks for circular dependencies → throws "Circular dependency detected" if found
+   e. Executes the entryPoint in sandbox with dependencies in context
+   f. Returns `{ resolved: ResolvedVersion[], result: SandboxResult }`
+
+### Verification
+- createMarketplace returns all 6 methods (5 services + installPlugin)
+- installPlugin validates manifest fields
+- installPlugin registers the plugin
+- installPlugin resolves and returns deps
+- installPlugin detects circular deps and throws
+- installPlugin executes sandbox and returns result
+- installPlugin succeeds end-to-end with valid input
